    "identityConstraints": [
      "Pluto must remain a function-bearing actor.",
      "Its default function is regeneration, not destruction.",
      "Elimination is a mechanism within regeneration, not the complete identity.",
      "Exposure must be distinguished from punishment.",
      "Power must be treated as capacity, leverage, concentration, or agency, not moral worth.",
